\begin{definition}[非负函数的Lebesgue积分]
\label{def:analysis-nonnegative-lebesgue-integral}
在测度空间$(X,\mathcal{A},\mu)$上，非负可测函数$f:X\to[0,\infty]$的积分定义为
\begin{equation}
  \int_X f\,\mathrm{d}\mu
  =
  \sup\left\{
    \int_X s\,\mathrm{d}\mu:
